Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ITEM-ARENA law (arena/pick) and its 2D view

One verified kit item per level: aim, fire, graded against the verified key in code. The first shot is the evidence; a
miss darkens that option and shows the kit's hint rung (never the key); claim fields never decide. 2D view: the question
is the goal line (unclamped DOM text, Devanagari renders), lettered option buttons and targets. Every bank challenge is
served by the picker; >= 2000-act random battery.

